oáng như CaCO\u003cspan style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; position: relative; font-size: 12px; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; bottom: -0.25em;\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e, Mg, P, K, Fe, Zn, Se, Cr, molybdan… cho cơ thể.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 6pt 0in; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 16.8pt; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle;\" src=\"https://chiaki.vn/upload/news/content/2017/10/tao-xoan-spirulina-algae-1-jpg-1508817117-24102017105157.jpg\" alt=\"Tảo Xoắn Spirulina Algae 100% Dạng Túi 2400 Viên\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 6pt 0in; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 16.8pt; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cem style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"\u003eHàm lượng dinh dưỡng trong tảo mặt trời Spirulina Nhật Bản cao hơn hẳn so với các thực phẩm tự nhiên khác\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 6pt 0in; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-